[{"id":"fm-core2-2.18-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Sketch the following graphs, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\coth x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/solutions/assets/diagrams/218-s1a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/solutions/assets/diagrams/218-s1b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/solutions/assets/diagrams/218-s1c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.18-q2","number":2,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>By sketching the curves with equations <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosh x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> on the same axes, show that they have exactly one point of intersection.</p></li><li><p>Find the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-coordinate of the point of intersection of the two curves, writing your answer in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac12\\ln(a+\\sqrt b)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are positive integers.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/solutions/assets/diagrams/218-s2a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\cosh x=\\cosech x \" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\cosh x =\\frac1{\\sinh x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\sinh x\\cosh x =1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\frac12\\sinh2x =1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\sinh2x =2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow2x =\\ln(2+\\sqrt{2^2+1})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow x =\\frac12\\ln(2+\\sqrt5).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Alternatively:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\cosh x=\\cosech x \" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\cosh x =\\frac1{\\sinh x}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\sinh x\\cosh x =1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\frac{e^x-e^{-x}}2\\times\\frac{e^x+e^{-x}}2 =1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow(e^x-e^{-x})(e^x+e^{-x}) =4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow e^{2x}-e^{-2x} =4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow e^{2x}-e^{-2x}-4 =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow e^{4x}-1-4e^{2x} =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow e^{4x}-4e^{2x}-1 =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow(e^{2x}-2)^2-4-1 =0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow(e^{2x}-2)^2 =5\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow e^{2x}-2 =\\sqrt5.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Note that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"e^{2x}-2\\ne-\\sqrt5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> as <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"e^{2x}-2&gt;-2&gt;-\\sqrt5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\therefore e^{2x} =2+\\sqrt5\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow2x =\\ln(2+\\sqrt5)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow x =\\frac12\\ln(2+\\sqrt5).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.18-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Find the equation of each of the following graphs in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sech(x-a)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sech x+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integers:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/questions/assets/diagrams/218-q3a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/questions/assets/diagrams/218-q3b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>The curve must be of the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sech x+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. The curve passes through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(\\ln(2+\\sqrt3),0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n0 =\\sech(\\ln(2+\\sqrt3))+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow-b =\\frac1{\\cosh(\\ln(2+\\sqrt3))}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\cosh(\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)) =-\\frac1b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\frac{e^{\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)}+e^{-\\ln(2+\\sqrt3)}}2 =-\\frac1b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\frac{(2+\\sqrt3)+(2+\\sqrt3)^{-1}}2 =-\\frac1b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\frac{(2+\\sqrt3)+(2-\\sqrt3)}2 =-\\frac1b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow2 =-\\frac1b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow b =-\\frac12.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Therefore, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sech x-\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>The curve must be of the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sech(x-a)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. The curve passes through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left(0,\\frac{2e^3}{1+e^6}\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{2e^3}{1+e^6} =\\sech(-a)=\\sech a\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\frac{2e^3}{1+e^6} =\\frac1{\\cosh a}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\cosh a =\\frac{1+e^6}{2e^3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow a =\\pm\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+e^6}{2e^3}+\\sqrt{\\left(\\frac{1+e^6}{2e^3}\\right)^2-1}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\pm\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+e^6}{2e^3}+\\sqrt{\\frac{e^{12}-2e^6+1}{4e^6}}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\pm\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+e^6}{2e^3}+\\frac{e^6-1}{2e^3}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\pm\\ln(e^3)=\\pm3.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>The curve has clearly been translated to the left, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Therefore, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sech(x+3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.18-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>State the equations of the asymptotes of the following graphs:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\coth(x+1)+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\coth(x-2)-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-1,\\ y=2,\\ y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2,\\ y=-2,\\ y=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.18-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Sketch each of the following graphs, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\coth x+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\coth(x-3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\coth(x-1)+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n0 =\\coth x+2\\Rightarrow\\coth x=-2\\Rightarrow\\tanh x=-\\frac12,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx =\\frac12\\ln\\left(\\frac{1-\\frac12}{1+\\frac12}\\right)=\\frac12\\ln\\frac13.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/solutions/assets/diagrams/218-s5a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\ny =\\coth(-3)=\\frac{\\cosh(-3)}{\\sinh(-3)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{e^{-3}+e^3}{e^{-3}-e^3}=\\frac{1+e^6}{1-e^6}\\approx-1.005.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/solutions/assets/diagrams/218-s5b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\ny =\\coth(-1)+1=\\frac{e^{-1}+e^1}{e^{-1}-e^1}+1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{1+e^2}{1-e^2}+1=\\frac{2}{1-e^2}\\approx-0.313.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/solutions/assets/diagrams/218-s5c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.18-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>Sketch each of the following graphs, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2\\coth x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac13\\coth x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\coth x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol><p><strong>Prerequisite knowledge for Q7--Q8: Combinations of Graph Transformations</strong></p>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/solutions/assets/diagrams/218-s6a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/solutions/assets/diagrams/218-s6b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/solutions/assets/diagrams/218-s6c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.18-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Sketch each of the following graphs, identifying where they intersect the coordinate axes and the equations of any asymptotes:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2-\\cosech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\frac13\\sech x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2\\coth x-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\cosech(2x+1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sech(3-x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\coth\\left(\\frac12x-3\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/solutions/assets/diagrams/218-s7a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/solutions/assets/diagrams/218-s7b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/solutions/assets/diagrams/218-s7c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/solutions/assets/diagrams/218-s7d.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/solutions/assets/diagrams/218-s7e.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/solutions/assets/diagrams/218-s7f.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.18-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Suggest an equation for the curve shown in the diagram below:</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.18/questions/assets/diagrams/218-q8.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","steps":["<p>It appears to be a transformation of the curve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\coth x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, including a reflection in either the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> axes. We know that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is an odd function, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\coth(-x)=-\\coth x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so we can focus our attention on a reflection in the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis without causing problems.</p>","<p>The curve has horizontal asymptotes at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so no vertical stretches or translations have been applied. The curve has a vertical asymptote at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, which might suggest <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\coth(-x-8)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. However, there may have been a horizontal stretch applied, so we must consider <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\coth(ax+b)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where we will expect <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to be a negative constant. Because of the vertical asymptote at <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, we must have <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"8a+b=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>The curve passes through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left(0,\\frac{e^8+1}{e^8-1}\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{e^8+1}{e^8-1} =\\coth b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\frac{e^8+1}{e^8-1} =\\frac1{\\tanh b}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\tanh b =\\frac{e^8-1}{e^8+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow b =\\frac12\\ln\\left(\\frac{1+\\frac{e^8-1}{e^8+1}}{1-\\frac{e^8-1}{e^8+1}}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac12\\ln\\left(\\frac{(e^8+1)+(e^8-1)}{(e^8+1)-(e^8-1)}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac12\\ln\\left(\\frac{2e^8}{2}\\right)=\\frac12\\ln(e^8)=4.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>If <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"8a+4=0\\Rightarrow a=-\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Therefore,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\ny=\\coth\\left(-\\frac12x+4\\right).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]}]